  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "text": "キャンプ　りょうりの　しょくざい。\nひとふりで　カレーを　きょだいに　する\nふしぎな　スパイス。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "캠프 요리의 식재료.\n조금만 넣어도 카레를 거대하게 만드는\n신기한 향신료.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "製作露營料理時使用的食材。\n神奇的香料，輕輕一撒就能\n讓咖哩變得巨大無比。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Un ingrédient de cuisine pour le camping.\nUne simple pincée de cette épice mystérieuse\npermet de donner une taille démesurée au curry.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Eine Zutat für PokéCamping-Mahlzeiten. Dieses\ngeheimnisvolle Gewürz macht Currygerichte auf\neinen Schlag gigantisch.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Un ingrediente para cocinar en el campamento. Una\npizca de esta extraña especia basta para elaborar un\ncurri gigantesco.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Uno degli ingredienti per cucinare in campeggio.\nBasta un pizzico di questa spezia misteriosa per\ningigantire qualsiasi curry.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "One of the many ingredients that can be used for\ncooking at your camp. A mysterious spice. Even a tiny\nsprinkle is sure to make a curry gigantic.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "キャンプ　料理の　食材。\n一振りで　カレーを　巨大に　する\n不思議な　スパイス。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "在露营营地制作料理时会使用的食材。\n只要把这种神奇的香辛料往咖喱上\n轻轻一撒，咖喱就会变得巨大无比。",
      "version_group": {
